merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-1 = Hello.
merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-2 = You look at me strangely. Is something the matter?
merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-3 = Buy or do not buy, but do ask no questions of me.
merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-4 = Something higher steers you on your path. Are you okay?
merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-5 = Greetings, stranger.
merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-6 = You have a certain, strange look to you. Something very wrong.
merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-7 = Have you thought of what would've changed had you never existed?
merchant-dialogue-kettlehead-8 = Look upon my wares and see what you may want.
